mp ($27.90) + Kitchen Scale ($24.90) = $456.10 - 6 items! That's under $500!\n\nLet me check: 249.90 + 134.90 + 7.50 + 11.00 + 27.90 + 24.90 = 456.10. Yes!\n\nOr: Jacket ($249.90) + Mat ($58) + Pencil Sharpener ($7.50) + Chair ($11.00) + Hand Pump ($27.90) + Kitchen Scale ($24.90) = $379.20 - 6 items\n\nOr: Jacket ($249.90) + Pack ($134.90) + Mat ($58) + Pencil Sharpener ($7.50) + Chair ($11.00) = $461.30 - 5 items\n\nLet me try: Jacket ($249.90) + Pack ($134.90) + Pencil Sharpener ($7.50) + Chair ($11.00) + Hand Pump ($27.90) + Kitchen Scale ($24.90) = $456.10 - 6 items. That's the most items I can get.\n\nActually, let me check: Mat ($58) + Pack ($134.90) + Pencil Sharpener ($7.50) + Chair ($11.00) + Hand Pump ($27.90) + Kitchen Scale ($24.90) + Helmet ($229.90) = $494.10 - 7 items! That's under $500!\n\nLet me verify: 58 + 134.90 + 7.50 + 11 + 27.90 + 24.90 + 229.90 = 494.10. Yes! 7 items!\n\nLet me also check if I can add the Jacket instead of some: Jacket ($249.90) + Mat ($58) + Pencil Sharpener ($7.50) + Chair ($11.00) + Hand Pump ($27.90) + Kitchen Scale ($24.90) = $379.20 - 6 items. That's fewer.\n\nSo the best is: Mat ($58) + Pack ($134.90) + Pencil Sharpener ($7.50) + Chair ($11.00) + Hand Pump ($27.90) + Kitchen Scale ($24.90) + Helmet ($229.90) = $494.10 - 7 items!\n\nLet me add them to the cart. I'll clear the cart first to start fresh.",
